  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Political and Inclusion Support for Civilian Democratic Coalition in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A credible and more inclusive democratic civilian-led government is possible, as part of peace processes in Sudan. The project has a special focus on strengthening the women&#x2019;s sector within the Civilian Democratic Coalition to increase capacity and strategic planning abilities, for enhanced influence in the organization. 

Outcomes: 
1. Increased representation of diverse Sudanese civilian voices in political processes.
2. New governance and coordination structures facilitate dialogue and enable cohesive and strategic engagement in the political process.</narrative>
  </description>
